{
    "title": "Sky News: Breaking, UK & World",
    "description": "Get the full story, first. Free, wherever you get your news.\r\n\r\nDownload our app for award-winning journalism and breaking news stories from the UK and around the world.\r\n\r\nAt Sky News, our mission is to give you the \u200bfull story, first, wherever you get your news. Because when you\u2019ve got the full story, you can make up your own mind. We believe this has never mattered more.\r\n\r\nWe give you the full story, first:\r\n- Taking you there, 24:7. So you can see what\u2019s really happening.\r\n- Asking the big questions. So you can find out what matters.\r\n- Through bold and independent reporting. Giving you a fresh perspective.\r\n\r\nKey features:\r\n- Breaking news notifications - be the first to find out about major developing stories\r\n- Watch Sky News live\r\n- Listen to our podcasts including Sky News Daily, Electoral Dysfunction and Politics at Jack and Sam\u2019s\r\n- Easy navigation to see headlines on multiple topics from politics to entertainment\r\n- Read articles while you\u2019re offline\r\n- Dark mode - change your preferences any time from the settings cog\r\n\r\nPlease note: Watching video may incur additional mobile network and/or WiFi charges.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Get the full story, first. Free, wherever you get your news.<br><br>Download our app for award-winning journalism and breaking news stories from the UK and around the world.<br><br>At Sky News, our mission is to give you the \u200bfull story, first, wherever you get your news. Because when you\u2019ve got the full story, you can make up your own mind. We believe this has never mattered more.<br><br>We give you the full story, first:<br>- Taking you there, 24:7. So you can see what\u2019s really happening.<br>- Asking the big questions. So you can find out what matters.<br>- Through bold and independent reporting. Giving you a fresh perspective.<br><br>Key features:<br>- Breaking news notifications - be the first to find out about major developing stories<br>- Watch Sky News live<br>- Listen to our podcasts including Sky News Daily, Electoral Dysfunction and Politics at Jack and Sam\u2019s<br>- Easy navigation to see headlines on multiple topics from politics to entertainment<br>- Read articles while you\u2019re offline<br>- Dark mode - change your preferences any time from the settings cog<br><br>Please note: Watching video may incur additional mobile network and/or WiFi charges.",
